       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.                                         00002000
       PROGRAM-ID.           TDLYCHGS.                                  00003000
       AUTHOR.               MELINDA MADDEN.                            00004000
       DATE-WRITTEN.         JUNE 18, 1986.                             00005000
      *INSTALLATION.         GOODYEAR TIRE AND RUBBER CO.               00006000
                                                                        00007000
      *REMARKS.              THIS PROGRAM WILL READ THROUGH THE         00008000
      *                      DAILY ABSTFILE CREATED FROM CUTOFF         00009000
      *                      AND PRINT ONLY THE TRANSACTIONS LABELED    00010000
      *                      "ISS", "RET", "ADJ" BY DEPARTMENT CODE.    00011000
      *                      THIS REPORT WILL BE SORTED BY EXPENSE      00012000
      *                      TYPE AND BY SHIFT.                         00013000
      *C
      *C  11JAN1994    DAVE PLUM    REQUEST #6462
      *C  REVISED PROGRAM LOGIC TO SKIP THOSE TC 332 RECORDS WHICH HAVE
      *C  A ZERO ADJUSTMENT QUANTITY (AND TC332-ADJUST NOT = 0).
      *C
      *C  02FEB1994    DAVE PLUM    -TEMPORARY SPECIAL VERSION-
      *C  TEMPORARILY REVISE THE HARDCODED SHIFT SCHEDULE TO MEET
      *C  LAWTON'S REQUIREMENTS UNTIL MORE PERMANENT CHANGES CAN
      *C  BE MADE TO COMPLETELY REMOVE THE HARDCODING OF SHIFT START
      *C  AND STOP TIMES.
      *C
      *C  07FEB1994    DAVE PLUM
      *C    ADDED CALL TO THE COBOL ERROR HANDLER - MCXCBLERR.
      *C
      *C  10/14/1994   CATHY ZUBEK
      *C    ADDED KEY TO MACCOUNT (KEY=SHFT) TO INDICATE NUMBER OF
      *C    SHIFTS IN PLANT.  PROGRAM READS KEY DATA AND PERFORMS
      *C    CORRESPONDING LOGIC FOR 2 OR 3 SHIFTS.
      *C
      *C  10/27/1994   CATHY ZUBEK    REQ #: 5619
      *C    1.)  ADDED COPYLIB MEMBERS AND CHANGED ALL REFERENCES TO
      *C         WORKING-STORAGE FIELDS TO THE COPYLIB MEMBER FIELDS.
      *C    2.)  ADDED LOGIC TO HANDLE 4XX TRANSACTIONS (430 & 433) AND
      *C         ENLARGED WORKING-STORAGE FIELD SIZES TO ACCOMMODATE
      *C         THE 4XX TRANSACTIONS.
      *C    3.)  INCREASED SIZE OF OUTPUT FIELDS TO HANDLE 4XX TRANS-
      *C         ACTIONS.
      *C    4.)  REPLACED "000215" HARD-CODED LOGIC WITH REFERENCES TO
      *C         MACCOUNT-INFO, WHERE KEY=SADJ.
      *C    5.)  ADDED TBLOWUP COPYLIB MEMBER AND TBLOWUP LOGIC.
      *C
      *C  11/25/1997   CATHY YODER    REQ #: 97-014
      *C    DIRECTED PRINTED OUTPUT TO FILE "DDLYCHGS" INSTEAD OF TO
      *C    MCPRT.  THIS WILL ALLOW PROCESSING THE REPORT THROUGH
      *C    "TPRTRPT" WHICH WILL DIRECT THE OUTPUT TO DIFFERENT OUTQs
      *C    BASED ON DEPARTMENT.
      *C
      *C  01/04/1998   JIM COFFMAN
      *C    PER JANE TURNER VERBAL REQUEST, ADDED THE ABILITY TO
      *C    INDICATE 'ISSI' STOREROOM FRENACHISED PART ISSUES FROM
      *C    GOODYEAR STOREROOM PART ISSUES.
      *C
      *C  01/21/2002   BRUCE GEISER
      *C    ADD PAGE AT END OF REPORT FOR GRAND TOTALS.
      *C

